### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### D1 — Spring Boot Project Structure
### Base URL : http://localhost:8090
### Server   : Embedded Tomcat
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090

### ── 1. GET All Employees ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/emp/controller/getDetails
Accept: application/json

### ── 2. GET Employee by ID (existing) ────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/emp/controller/getDetailsById/10001
Accept: application/json

### ── 3. GET Employee by ID (not found → 404) ─────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/emp/controller/getDetailsById/99999
Accept: application/json

### ── 4. POST Add New Employee ─────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/emp/controller/addEmp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeName": "Alice",
  "salary": 50000.0,
  "departmentCode": 1004
}

### ── 5. PUT Update Existing Employee ─────────────────────

PUT {{baseUrl}}/emp/controller/updateEmp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeName": "Jack Updated",
  "employeeId": 10001,
  "salary": 75000.0,
  "departmentCode": 1001
}

### ── 6. PUT Update Non-Existent Employee (→ 500) ─────────

PUT {{baseUrl}}/emp/controller/updateEmp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeName": "Ghost",
  "employeeId": 99999,
  "salary": 10000.0,
  "departmentCode": 9999
}

### ── 7. DELETE Employee by ID ─────────────────────────────

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/emp/controller/deleteEmp/10003
Accept: application/json

### ── 8. DELETE Non-Existent Employee (→ 500) ─────────────

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/emp/controller/deleteEmp/99999
Accept: application/json
